{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"456677ee5f530a55036c148b493beeb4550b2d03494fe29181083852bcdd0746","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["要为他人祷告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我劝你首先要为所有的人恳求、祷告、代求和感谢上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["也要为所有的君王和掌权者祷告，使我们可以怀着虔诚、端正的心过和平安宁的生活。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["这样做很美好，是蒙我们的救主上帝悦纳的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因为祂愿世人都得救，明白真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝只有一位，在上帝和世人之间只有一位中保，就是降世为人的基督耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["祂舍命作所有人的赎价，这在所定的时候已显明出来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["为此，我被指派做传道人和使徒，教导外族人认识信仰和真理。我说的是实话，并非谎言。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["信徒的操守"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我愿男人举起圣洁的手随处祷告，不发怒，不争辩",{"noteId":0},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我愿女人衣着得体，朴素端庄，不靠发型、珠宝金饰或名贵衣服来妆饰自己，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["要有善行，这样才配称为敬畏上帝的女人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女人应当安安静静地学习，完全顺服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我不准女人教导或管辖男人，她们应当保持安静。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为先造的是亚当，后造的是夏娃，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["并非亚当受骗，而是夏娃受骗陷入罪中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["不过，女人如果持守信心和爱心，圣洁自律，就必在生育的事上得救。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“争辩”或译“疑惑”。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}